│                                                                         │
│  LIMITS                                                                 │
│  ├─► LEAF only: no Task tool, sub-agents, web fetch, browser, or patch  │
│  └─► Scope restriction is convention-level, not harness enforcement     │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

